<title>SPAIN: Death toll in Spain derailment rises to 21 - TV.</title>
<headline>Death toll in Spain derailment rises to 21 - TV.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The death toll rose to 21 in a passenger train derailment in northern Spain on Monday night, state television reported.</p>
<p>Authorities said at least 50 people were injured, including 18 in serious condition, and other victims remained trapped in the wreckage.</p>
</text>
